---
/** The panoramic close: a mountain range drawn in the brand's navy and gold. Replace with the approved photograph when it arrives. */
---
<svg class="w-full h-full block" viewBox="0 0 1440 420" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMax slice" aria-hidden="true" role="presentation">
